      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Intensity is power per area. Since power has units kg m² s⁻³, intensity has units kg s⁻³.",
        "For Kvρf²A², K has no unit, while v has m s⁻¹, ρ has kg m⁻³, f² has s⁻² and A² has m².",
        "Multiplying the right-hand units gives kg s⁻³.",
        "Both sides therefore have SI base units kg s⁻³."
      ],
