      "hints": [
        "The source moves towards the observer, so use the moving-source form with v − vₛ in the denominator.",
        "Substitute the observed frequency, horn frequency and sound speed before rearranging for vₛ."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "For a source moving towards a stationary observer, fₒ = vfₛ / (v − vₛ).",
        "Substitute: 550 = (340 × 510) / (340 − vₛ).",
        "Multiply through: 550(340 − vₛ) = 173 400.",
        "187 000 − 550vₛ = 173 400, so 550vₛ = 13 600.",
        "vₛ = 13 600 / 550 = 24.7 m s⁻¹, which is 25 m s⁻¹ to two significant figures."
      ],
